    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nREA Donohoe Spring are delighed to bring to the market this Spacious 4 Bed Mid-Terrace Residence Featuring a Large, Private Enclosed Rear Garden. Requires Modernisation Throughout. Qualifies for Vacant Property Grant. Excellent Potential For Family Home or Investment. Short Walking Distance to Local Amenities. FOR SALE BY PRIVATE TREATY.\n\n \n\nThe living accommodation extends to C. 110 sqm/1184 sqft comprises;\n\nGround Floor: Entrance Hall (1.8 x 4.0) with under-stair storage, Living Room (4.0 x 3.3) with Solid file stove, Sitting Room (3.6 x 3.4) with open fireplace and built-in Press, Kitchen (5.1 x 2.5), Dining Room (4.5 x 2.6) with patio doors. To the rear of the ground floor is a partially covered concrete terrace (7.2 x 2.0) and externally excessed W.C. Utility (1.5 x 1.7).\n\n \n\nFirst Floor: Split level Landing (2.0 x 2.6), Bedroom 1 (3.8 x 3.1) with Closet (1.0 x 1.0) Hot Press (1.0 x 0.7), Bedroom 2 (3.8 x 3.2), Bedroom 3 (2.5 x 2.5), Bedroom 4 (2.6 x 3.4) and Bathroom (2.0 x 1.9). \n\n \n\nBuilt of standard block construction with plaster exterior finish, tile roof and double glazed windows, Connected to mains services, electric and dual central heating (solid fuel oil). BER: TBC.\n\n \n\nRequiring modernisation throughout but has excellent potential to make an ideal home for first time buyers, investors and those seeking a home close to amenities.\n\n \n\nThe property will qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant SEAI energy efficiency grants.\n\n \n\nExternally there is off-street parking a small lawn area to the front. The large private enclosed garden space to the rear is currently overgrown, but once cut back, has the potential to be a great outdoor space.\n\n \n\nSituated on the R201, just a short walk from all amenities in Killeshandra including Lakeland Dairies, Primary care centre, supermarkets, primary school, restaurants, pubs Town Lake. Killeshandra is at the heart of the Lakelands close to The Shannon/Erne Blueway Killykeen Forest Park. Just over 15 min drive to a wide range of amenities in Cavan Town. GPS: 54.016491, -7.526428.\n\n \n\nViewing By Appointment Only Highly Recommended. \n\n"
      }
    ],
